      fresh clone builds without any copy step.

      Replace both values with your own from
      https://developers.facebook.com/apps/ -> Settings -> Basic, and keep
      FACEBOOK_APP_ID / FACEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN in .env in sync with them so the
      Dart side and the native SDK agree.
